              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eyakitia apa ninche iltung'ana le Israel olomoni torrono le ina kop nashomo aaikitalan, ejo, “Ore ina kop nikishomo iyiook aaikitalan naa enkop nainos lelo oomanya, ore lelo tung'ana pooki likitoduaa te ina kop naa adoru naa iltung'ana sapuki oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
